OL,3,GNEWSALe Bon delighted with Duran Duran
OL,4,Astamp collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Le Bon has said the new Royal
OL,7,FMail stamp collection featuring Duran
OL,8,FDuran is a "massive visual validation
OL,9,Fof the band and its history".
OL,11,FThe stamps are being released to
OL,12,Fcelebrate the award-winning group's
OL,13,Falmost 48-year career and feature album
OL,14,Fartwork that charts their rise from the
OL,15,FBirmingham club scene.
OL,17,FLe Bon said the stamp collection was a
OL,18,F"pinch yourself" moment and added:
OL,19,F"Having stamps is a bit far out. Nobody
OL,20,Fwould have anticipated this at any
OL,21,Ftime."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
