OL,3,GNEWSALe Bon delighted with Duran Duran
OL,4,Astamp collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe band is famed for hits such as Rio,
OL,7,FHungry Like The Wolf and Ordinary World
OL,8,Fand achieved two UK number one singles
OL,9,Fand one chart-topping album.
